      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path:</strong> F3 (10%), F6 (10%), F4 (10%) converge on a picture of diplomatic stasis and frozen Hormuz traffic persisting through at least late October, consistent with Trump's explicit midterm-deferral framing.</p>
      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path:</strong> F6 at 10% and F3 at 10% set a very low floor — only a surprise mediator breakthrough or unexpected US-Iran unilateral halt before November 3 could open this path in the near term.</p>
